d mvgstudy. Multivariate generalizability and decision studies
d
d mvgstudy performs multivariate generalizability (G) studies,
d mvdstudy performs decision (D) studies, and mvcrr computes
d projected construct-relevant reliability.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Author: Steffen Erickson, University of Virginia
d Support: email cns8vg@virginia.edu
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260819
